        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Chrome 144 support for subgroup_id WGSL language feature]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28891</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28891"/>
        <updated>2026-01-22T15:55:26.000Z</updated>
