        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28854</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28854"/>
        <updated>2026-01-17T21:54:45.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27905767?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">…n text-decoration-style</p>
<p dir="auto">Observed in experiment.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Indicated Chrome 87-88 supports <code class="notranslate">text-decoration-thickness</code> when <code class="notranslate">text-decoration-style</code> is not <code class="notranslate">solid</code>.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<p dir="auto">Tested by visually checking in Chrome 87-88.<br>
Test case:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="&lt;!doctype html&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: solid underline 10px&quot;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: double underline 10px&quot;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: dotted underline 10px&quot;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: dashed underline 10px&quot;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
